// Residue twin of units/073 case B: the provisional CAPTURE route. `w` is a
// kernel-local let over the still-unresolved outer param, so the inner apply's
// own unit pass defers; the enclosing second pass then recomputes `w` through
// its `bound` map (2.0 * f = 1/day) and walks the inner kernel body with the
// inner param bound to ts's element unit, leaving 1/day * day * day = day.
//
// The reported unit matters as much as the code: `day` is the RESIDUE. If the
// recheck ever read the inner kernel's stale first-pass types instead, `w`
// would come back bare and the message would still say `day` -- so this pin
